{"ID":101,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2025-02-16 17:01:03","post_date_gmt":"2025-02-16 17:01:03","post_content":"Dobrodo\u0161li u svijet doma\u0107ih suhomesnatih proizvoda.\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Digitalna pu\u0161nica<\/h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Tradicija, znanje i precizne recepture za sve koji ozbiljno pristupaju izradi vrhunskih doma\u0107ih proizvoda. Stolje\u0107ima provjerene tehnike soljenja, dimljenja i zrenja na jednom mjestu.<\/p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tISTRA\u017dI \u2192\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>U\u010dimo zajedno: Tehnike, povijest i savjeti<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPREGLEDAJ SVE\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"533\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/PIXNIO-2710400-4000x6000-1-e1740215510653.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/PIXNIO-2710400-4000x6000-1-e1740215510653.jpg 533w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/PIXNIO-2710400-4000x6000-1-e1740215510653-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Enciklopedija znanja<\/h3><p>Baza znanja o svakom koraku procesa \u2014 od sirovine i soljenja, kroz fermentaciju i dimljenje, do gotovog proizvoda. Sustavno, precizno, s tablicama i shemama.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSAZNAJ VI\u0160E\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"533\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/pexels-marcelino-ibericos-97604224-9287523-1-e1740216055252.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/pexels-marcelino-ibericos-97604224-9287523-1-e1740216055252.jpg 533w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/pexels-marcelino-ibericos-97604224-9287523-1-e1740216055252-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Recepture<\/h3><p>Provjerene recepture s kalkulatorom koli\u010dina. Unesite masu svoje \u0161ar\u017ee \u2014 svi omjeri se automatski prilago\u0111avaju. Sol, za\u010dini, temperature, vremena \u2014 sve na jednom mjestu.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSAZNAJ VI\u0160E\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1700\" height=\"2560\" src=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-scaled.jpg 1700w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-680x1024.jpg 680w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-768x1156.jpg 768w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-1020x1536.jpg 1020w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/smoked-meat-700064-1360x2048.jpg 1360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1700px) 100vw, 1700px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Atlas stilova Europe<\/h3><p>Svaka regija Europe ima vlastiti rukopis. Mediteran, Panonska nizina, Alpe \u2014 istra\u017eite razlike, zajedni\u010dke korijene i lokalne specijalitete.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSAZNAJ VI\u0160E\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Najnoviji \u010dlanci<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"645\" src=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/wine-2027177-2-e1740215455845.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/wine-2027177-2-e1740215455845.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/wine-2027177-2-e1740215455845-600x378.jpg 600w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/wine-2027177-2-e1740215455845-300x189.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/wine-2027177-2-e1740215455845-768x484.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Tradicija zapisana, znanje dostupno<\/h2><p>Iza drycured.com stoji knjiga Enciklopedija suhomesnatih proizvoda (Davor Savicki, 2025) \u2014 vi\u0161egodi\u0161nji rad na terenu, u razgovorima s iskusnim majstorima. Najvrijednija znanja o izradi suhomesnatih proizvoda previ\u0161e su dugo bila zarobljena u glavama starih majstora. Ova platforma to mijenja.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Koristite enciklopediju kao priru\u010dnik kojemu se vra\u0107ate \u2014 za planiranje, izvedbu i kontrolu. Slobodno ozna\u010dujte, dopisujte i primjenjujte. Jer kad znanje ostane samo u sje\u0107anju, lako se izgubi.<\/p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSAZNAJ VI\u0160E\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t01\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Za hobiste i ku\u0107ne proizvo\u0111a\u010de<\/h3><p>Siguran i strukturiran okvir za prvu ili pedesetu \u0161ar\u017eu. Jasne upute, kriti\u010dne to\u010dke, bez misticizma.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t02\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Za iskusne mesare i majstore<\/h3><p>Referentni izvor i mapa kriti\u010dnih to\u010daka. Jezik kojim se iskustvo radionice mo\u017ee prenijeti dalje.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t03\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Za istra\u017eiva\u010de tradicije<\/h3><p>Regionalni stilovi, kulturni kontekst i povijest zanata diljem Europe \u2014 na jednom mjestu.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Za\u0161to je drycured.com jedinstven?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPreciznost\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTo\u010dni omjeri, temperaturni rasponi i vremenski okviri \u2014 ne otprilike, nego konkretno.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTradicija + znanost\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSvaki korak ima i prakti\u010dno i teorijsko obja\u0161njenje. Znate \u0161to radite i za\u0161to.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tZa sve razine\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tOd prve kobasice do profesionalne \u0161ar\u017ee \u2014 sadr\u017eaj koji raste s vama.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/alex-guillaume-lAZqUCAOvOk-unsplash-2-e1740216886301.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/alex-guillaume-lAZqUCAOvOk-unsplash-2-e1740216886301.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/alex-guillaume-lAZqUCAOvOk-unsplash-2-e1740216886301-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/alex-guillaume-lAZqUCAOvOk-unsplash-2-e1740216886301-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/alex-guillaume-lAZqUCAOvOk-unsplash-2-e1740216886301-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Spoj tradicije i digitalnog doba<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>U\u0111ite u svijet suhomesnatih proizvoda i pridru\u017eite se zajednici istinskih zaljubljenika u tradiciju, znanje i dobru praksu. Otkrijte provjerene recepture, tehnike i korisne savjete u digitalnom formatu.<\/p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPO\u010cNI ISTRA\u017dIVATI\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>","post_title":"Home","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"pocetna","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2026-05-06 09:58:06","post_modified_gmt":"2026-05-06 09:58:06","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/swabtools.com\/pocetna\/","menu_order":0,"post_type":"page","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","url":"https:\/\/drycured.com\/"}
